#. module: bf_nfc_round
#: model:bf.nfc.gesture,description:bf_nfc_round.gesture_round_checkpoint
msgid ""
"Chaque point d'une tournée porte sa pastille. La taper note le passage, dit "
"où on en est, et ferme la tournée au dernier point. Sans réseau, le passage "
"garde l'heure du téléphone."
msgstr ""
"Each checkpoint of a round has its tag. Tapping it records the visit, says "
"where you are, and closes the round at the last checkpoint. Without a "
"network, the visit keeps the phone's time."

#. module: bf_nfc_round
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_nfc_round.view_bf_nfc_round_form
msgid ""
"Chaque point reçoit une pastille « Point de tournée » : enregistrez les\n"
"                                points, puis « Créer les pastilles des points ». Un point qui a déjà la\n"
"                                sienne est sauté."
msgstr ""
"Each checkpoint gets a “Round checkpoint” tag: save the checkpoints, then "
"“Create checkpoint tags”. A checkpoint that already has its own is skipped."

